# Test artifacts
coverage/
lcov.info

# Sub-Phase 4.5B: cargo-ndk output. `mobile/android/app/src/main/jniLibs/`
# holds the cross-compiled `parda-mobile-bridge` shared objects (~200 MB of
# debug binaries for two ABIs). Reproducible build artifacts, not source —
# regenerate with:
#   cargo ndk -t x86_64 -t arm64-v8a -o mobile/android/app/src/main/jniLibs \
#     build -p parda-mobile-bridge
mobile/android/app/src/main/jniLibs/

# A nested clone of this repository was committed by accident as a bare
# gitlink (no .gitmodules), which left anyone cloning with an empty,
# unpopulatable `Parda/` directory and made `flutter analyze` from the
# repo root scan a stale duplicate tree.
/Parda/
